model tb
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

kind ks

input amt: money PLN
input fee[m in months]: money PLN
input wd[k in ks]: date

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee[m]

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  ks + [k1, k2, k3] lives 2026-01-01..
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  fee[2026-03..2026-05] = 10.00 PLN "s"
  fee[2026-06] = none "s"
  wd[k1] = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "s"
  wd[k2] = 2026-03-10 "s"
  wd[k3] = 2026-03-20 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

ask n233_7: fee[2026-06] + amt
ask a221_10: count(k in ks on 2026-03-01 where wd[k] > 2026-03-06), any(wd[k] > 2026-03-06 for k in ks on 2026-03-01), all(wd[k] > 2026-03-06 for k in ks on 2026-03-01), sum(days_between(2026-03-01, wd[k]) for k in ks on 2026-03-01), min(wd[k] for k in ks on 2026-03-01)
ask c233_8: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known (2027-01-01)
ask c233_8t: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2027-01-01
